window.products.push({"id":342122,"name":"Oopat DIY Black and Gold Balloon Garland Arch Kit for 50th 60th Birthday Graduation Anniversary Thanksgiving New Year Retirements Party Backdrop Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MKHXCAgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THROW THE MOST AMAZING PARTY: Black is a great masculine colour when you're celebrating HIS birthday. Add a pop of colour for contrast or go a classic gold and black. Doesn't matter what you do with the colour palette, we know we have the props to suit! QUALITY YOU CAN ACTUALLY DEPEND ON: All of our latex balloons are made from high-quality natural latex which is created from the sap of rubber trees – an organic material that is fully biodegradable. Please bear in mind that photo may vary slightly from actual item in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or the monitor's display. EVERYTHING INCLUDED: an assortment of 18”/10” /5” latex balloons in black and chrome gold balloons and a 16.4ft plastic decorator strip. Package will arrive uninflated. Leaves/flowers not included. and all you need to have is your own Balloon Hand Pump. There is not leaves, flowers or any other decoration. Believe it or not, these are not hard to assemble! Does not require any previous balloon handling or crafting experience. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Our kits include EVERYTHING you need to create a beautiful balloon garland for your party! Assembly 10-14 ft garlands will take approximately an hour and a half. The garland can be created 1-2 days in advance. For best results, inflate within 48 hours of your event, but closer is better. Instructions for the garland as reference in descriptions, and you can create your own style by searching on youtube tutorials. YOUR HAPPINESS TRULY MATTERS TO US: At Oopat, there’s nothing more important to us than your 100% satisfaction. After all, it’s what keeps us going. So, if you experience any issues with your balloon arch and garland kit, just contact us directly and you will promptly receive a good solution with no questions asked. Order Now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MKHXCAgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oopat","source_asin":"B0B1M8BYLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1M8BYLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1M8BYLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
