window.products.push({"id":342157,"name":"Kuzmaly Waterproof Mattress Protector Ultra Soft Breathable 3D Air Bamboo Material Bed Mattress Pad Protector Cover Quilted, Fitted 8-18 inch Deep Poc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XsDvim-ML._AC_.jpg","description":"The surface material is made of natural bamboo, soft and smooth,skin-friendly and more comfortable than cotton. 100% WATERPROOF : Our mattress protector has an advanced waterproof membrane layer to avoid the interference of annoying leaks and spills in daily liquids, keep it dry and clean, and will not produce any when moving freely on the bed Wrinkle sound, completely silent. PERFECT APPLICABILITY: Our 18-inch deep pocket design is compatible with all types of mattresses, and the stretchable elastic skirt prevents the mattress from moving and keeps it in place. MACHINE WASHABLE: Wash in cold water, easy to dry. CUSTOMER SERVICE: If you have any questions about this or want to know more information, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with solutions and help you solve the problem as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XsDvim-ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kuzmaly","source_asin":"B08PBSC18R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBSC18R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBSC18R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342158,"name":"Andency Black Quilt Set California King (112x104 Inch), 3 Pieces(1 Striped Triangle Printed Quilt and 2 Pillowcases), Bohemian Summer Lightweight Reve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8122GOw1VEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-soft and Lightweight】: Andency black quilt set is made of 100% premium quality microfiber. The material is stitched in a multilayered construction that creates lightweight, durable quilts for use year-round. 【Exquisite Workmanship & Economically Reversible】: Andency black bohemian quilt set adopts excellent stitching technology and the same wiring method on both sides which prevents the fiberfill shifting and lets it reversible at the same time. You can get a reversible one with double use and the durable material will not fade and shrink after washing, allowing it for long years of use. 【Printed Novel Boho Style】: Unlike traditional bohemian style with its bright colors and patterns, the simple black lines with the tone expresses understated simplicity, allowing you to keep up with the trend while maintaining your uniqueness and personality. 【Multi-Purpose Usage for All Season】: With the decorated geometric pattern outside, you can perfectly use it as a bedspread to keep your comforter clean if you like to sleep with your pet(s) or to keep warm in colder season; Lightweight and breathable, you can use it as a quilted coverlet if you have night sweats or turn down the comforter in summer or air-conditioned room. 【3Pcs Quilt Set You Can Get】：The California King size quilt set includes one quilt (112\" x 104\"), two pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). NOTE: The Size May Vary According to Different Colors, Please Check The Size Information Before Buying.Choose a Larger Size If You Want the Picture-like Effect. 【Easy Care for Time Saving】: Easy to clean (No pets' fur left). Our quilt set fits for gentle cycle machine wash cold, tumble dry with low heat. Please do not bleach, light iron if you needed. We have absolute confidence and credit for you to trust!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8122GOw1VEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andency","source_asin":"B08TQF75FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TQF75FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TQF75FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342159,"name":"Frywall 12 (Large) - Charcoal - Splatter Guard, as Seen on Shark Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TecumAuVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FRYWALL 12\" IS BIG – Verify your pan size before ordering. Frywall 12 fits 12\" pans. Will not fit pans with lip-to-lip diameters smaller than 11.5\". Not suitable for downdraft stoves. NO COMPROMISE PROTECTION: Combines uninterrupted protection with complete access to cooking surface, providing all the benefits of an uncovered pan without the mess. STOPS OIL MIST AND CONDENSATION: Completely blocks fine oil that splatter screens let through, but lets steam escape freely. So burgers sear perfectly, sauces reduce quickly, and condensation splatter is eliminated. SPILLOVER STOPPER: Perfect for preventing spillovers when sautéing lots of veggies and greens in overfull pan. SAFE, CLEAN AND COMPACT: Made of BPA-free, FDA-compliant silicone that can withstand sustained temperatures of up to 450°F. Dishwasher safe and easy to clean. After use rolls into cup-sized sleeve for compact storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TecumAuVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frywall","source_asin":"B0773L6YVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0773L6YVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0773L6YVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342160,"name":"Bush Furniture Yorktown L Shaped Desk with Storage, 60W, White Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Cz4ynUrjS._AC_.jpg","description":"The Bush Furniture Yorktown 60W L Shaped Desk with Storage is an ideal way to maximize the potential of your personal workspace. Designed for placement against a wall, the corner desk saves valuable floor space while still allowing you to work comfortably with a desktop that extends 60 inches in each direction. Its durable work surface easily supports a computer, books and more with a weight capacity of 200 pounds, so you can keep important materials on hand as you take on your next project or assignment. The desktop also has a built-in wire management grommet to accommodate cords and cables. Storage features include a file drawer that opens on smooth full-extension ball bearing slides for an effortless reach to letter-size paperwork, a box drawer for miscellaneous office supplies, and an open cubby shelf for work-in-progress. Yorktown's quality craftsmanship is highlighted by beveled edge detailing and oil-rubbed Bronze hardware for a time-worn classic appearance. Complement your own unique style with four attractive finish options: Antique Cherry, Linen White Oak, Reclaimed Pine and Restored Gray. This home office desk with storage is tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty. See the full collection for coordinating items available, including an Office Chair, Hutch, 5 Shelf Bookcase, Lateral File Cabinet and Desktop Organizers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Cz4ynUrjS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B08GDJCRNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GDJCRNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GDJCRNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
