window.products.push({"id":342175,"name":"Scooter by Pat Saunders-White, 18x18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fbYOv5RqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a dog. Instantly recognizable, the brilliant, saturated colors of Pat Saunders-White;s animal paintings have established her as a national pet portrait artist. Pat brings an element of spontaneity, boldness and humor into a genre that is often stiff and photo realistic. Pat's big 'Ah-Ha!' moment was when she painted her first animal. Fourteen year later, she still finds this an exciting niche. The first animal paintings in this new style and technique gave her a feeling of 'coming home' after a long journey. Pat participates in juried national shows and presents workshops in her home studio and various workshop venues. She donates her work annually to non-profit fundraisers. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fbYOv5RqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLY599Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLY599Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLY599Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342176,"name":"Boston International 4-Piece Tidbit Bowls and Tray Set, Shore Thing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZQuNiB+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Shore Thing collection is a compilation of shell serving items, nautical decorative textiles and coastal living themed home decor pieces in timeless hues of blue, creamy linen, seafoam green and white. Look for wine charms, candle holders, bowls, coasters, pillows and more available separately in this coordinated motif. It was the love and appreciation of fine design along with the opportunity to create and market well-made yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to found Boston International (BI) in 1986. In the beginning, BI was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany and the UK. Through the years, the company developed and grew. In 1996, Boston International added Ideal Home Range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that, BI began its relationship with New York's Metropolitan Museum of Art. Through the combination of these lines, BI has become a major force in the gift industry today and currently partners with suppliers and manufacturers from around the globe to bring their vision to the US market. Boston International's philosophy is the same now as it was back in 1986. Combine the very best design with the highest quality materials and manufacturing, then add outstanding distribution and unmatched customer service. Currently over 19,000 customers in 11 countries are the beneficiaries of this philosophy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZQuNiB+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B00I0A7D0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I0A7D0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I0A7D0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342177,"name":"Mini Easter Egg Waffle Maker- Make Holiday Special w Cute Waffler Iron- Ready to Decorate Set Includes 4 Edible Food Markers w Recipe Guide - Fun East","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+jhnSYGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easter Egg Mini Waffle Maker - Make breakfast magical and fun with this adorable waffler iron! Food markers are food safe. Set includes the following colors: purple, blue, green, and red. Make 1 Easter egg waffle or pancake in just minutes. Recipes and instructions are included Tiny waffler stands upright for storage and has a nonstick coating for simple and easy cleanup Easter waffles or pan cakes are great for decorating. Great gift idea for children on birthday or holiday! A must have to bring fun and laughter to the kitchen! This electric, nonstick waffler iron is great for birthdays, parties, holidays or any special occasion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+jhnSYGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waffle Wow!","source_asin":"B09BZY2FT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BZY2FT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BZY2FT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342178,"name":"Dripless Taper Candles Dinner and Wedding Candles 12 Inches Tall - Set of 12 (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813y+jK8WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LET'S GIVE YOU SOME CANDLE EDUCATION: So if you are looking at this page you probably like candles, don't you? Let's give you some helpful info and tips on tapers to help you have the best buying and burning experience. MOLDED OR HAND-DIPPED? So there are several methods in manufacturing taper candles. One technique over the other may impact the candles appearance, price and quality. MOLDED TAPERS: The ones you're looking at now, are made as they're called in 'molds' that form a perfect shape of a taper candle. They will enhance your tables with a soldier-like posture, a perfect smooth profile; the preciseness in form, and eye-catching display of these candles make molded tapers a favorite to many. Now, Hand-Dipped candles use a more traditional process of the candle wicks being dipped in the wax several times till it gets the desired size and shape. The look of HAND-DIPPED candles are really elegant and rather traditional and more old-fashioned. The candles will be the same shape and size, but not as accurate as molded, each candles will have its uniqueness. Hand-dipped candles may also be a bit pricier. Depending on your likes and opinion, choose the candle that is right for you! OUR CANDLES ARE DRIPLESS. WHEN A CANDLE IS 'DRIPLESS', WHAT DOES THAT STATE? The term \"Dripless\" for a candle means that it is made of high quality wax and will not drip if you burn them correctly. HOW TO BURN CANDLES: Taper candles need to be in a candle holder that will hold the candle in a perfect upright position. Candles should be burned in still air at ambient room temperatures of about 21°C (70 °F). No matter how great quality a candle will be, if it's tilted or if a draft blows in the direction of the candle, the wick leans onto the wax right below, causing the flame to melt the side wall of the candle which results in drips. BURN CANDLES SAFELY! Never leave a burning candle unattended. Keep out of reach of children and pets. HAPPY CANDLE LIGHTING!:)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813y+jK8WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candle Charisma","source_asin":"B01LZ92HNE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZ92HNE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZ92HNE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
