window.products.push({"id":342205,"name":"Dirt Devil 082500 Breeze Bagless Canister Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Q718RKGML._AC_.jpg","description":"For a floor to ceiling clean look no further than the Breeze Bagless Canister by Dirt Devil. A powerful 12 AMP motor is similar to a full size upright with the tools and power to get the job done right. The bagless design means you can sweep and dispose of dirt easily. Simply dispose of your dirt and continue cleaning or store away with the compact design.  This vacuum can help clean all surfaces types from carpeting to hard floors. Two separate nozzles are included specially designed for each floor type – a bare floor nozzle and an additional nozzle for area rugs. Tools are conveniently stored on board for above floor cleaning such as window treatments, couches and upholstery. Large non-marring wheels help to maneuver this canister around your home. Swivel front wheel aides in smooth transitions across all floor types.  Tired of lugging a large cumbersome upright through your house and upstairs? This Breeze vacuum is equipped with a shoulder strap and weighs less than 12 lbs. Easily lift for above floor cleaning, up-stairs or from room to room. With the long reach and 20 foot power cord you are able to cover more ground efficiently. A crevice tool attachment helps get into hard to reach places and dusting brush for above floor cleaning. Equipped with on-board tools and lightweight design the Breeze Canister by Dirt Devil makes vacuuming easy. Product Features: • Lightweight Design – easy to carry up stairs or throughout your home  • Multi-Surface Cleaning – two different nozzles included for hard floors and area rugs • On-Board Tools – cleaning tools for different tasks  • Large Wheels – smoothly move across the floor  • Cord Hook – convenient storage hook for wrapping cord when finished working  • Bagless Design – easy empty container for dirt disposal directly into the trash  • Carrying Handle & Strap – compact design with contoured handle to lift easily with attachable straps for extra support  • 20 Foot Power Cord – long cord to reach further around a large area without having to re-plug  • HEPA Media Filtration – helps protect against 99.97% of dust and allergens  • 12 AMP Motor – congruent power to traditional uprights for a more thorough clean  • Warranty – 2 year limited  Included Accessories Included Accessories: Bare Floor Nozzle – straight suction nozzle for hard floor surfaces Additional Nozzle – bare floor nozzle with nylon bristles for small area rugs and hard floors Crevice Tool – reach tight spaces with specialized thin tool Dusting Brush – extra agitation for above floor cleaning Easy empty dirt disposal system to dump directly into the trash Bare floor nozzle included for straight suction on hard floor surfaces Tool attachments to effectively clean above floor, drapes, couches and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Q718RKGML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dirt Devil","source_asin":"B008MASHKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008MASHKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008MASHKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
