window.products.push({"id":342223,"name":"Zak Designs Solid Blue 12-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31798A4QE4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The timeless round shape of the Solid Blue Melamine meets the needs of many consumers. This line is a natural companion to many patterned programs or can be a healthy stand alone item. The solid Blue Melamine line is offered in a 12 piece dinnerware set. Including 4 dinner plates, 4 salad plates, and 4 small bowls Amazon.com Zak Designs' melamine dinnerware avoids the worries of ceramic dishes for outdoor dining. Melamine is a tough, break-resistant material that not only stands up to steak knives and brick patios, but looks modern in its simplicity. Solid cobalt blue in color, which allows it to mix and match with other sets, the set includes four of each of the following: a ten-inch dinner plate, an eight-inch salad or sandwich plate, and a six-inch-diameter bowl for soup, cereal, or ice cream that hold approximately three cups. All the pieces are lightweight and elegantly thin, not clunky in the least. One of the hottest trend-setters in tableware, Zak Designs produces colorful cartoon-covered melamine ware for children as well as retro-look melamine, ceramic, and polycarbonate dinner- and drinkware for adults. While not suitable for microwave use, melamine dinnerware is safe for the top rack of a dishwasher and nests very compactly for slipping into a picnic basket or storing in a cozy RV, boat, or vacation cabin kitchen. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-inch dinner plate; 8-inch salad plate; 6-inch bowl. 12 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31798A4QE4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B0009ET6ES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009ET6ES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009ET6ES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
