window.products.push({"id":342293,"name":"Hjemstuff Premium Vacuum Storage Bags. 70% More Storage! 2 Medium 2 Large Vacuum Compression Storage Bags & Electric Pump for Travel Included Double-Z","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H7UUSw34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your belongings - Unlike other roll-up vacuum storage bags that you have to spend time and effort to remove the air only for it to be returned to the original state, our Vacuum Storage Bags has a valve and cover to prevent air from entering the bags again. With no air in these vacuum storage bags, there will be no dust, moisture, musty odors, or discoloration on your belongings and you can store them longer! Space Saving Essential - Keep your closet and wardrobe neat and tidy, squeeze more things into your luggage when traveling. Hjemstuff Portable Mini Automatic USB Vacuum Pump & Inflator with Vacuum Storage Bags is the best solution for you. This portable vacuum pump can compress and reduce your storage space up to 3 times smaller! Minimalist Design - The pump is designed and made to be small and light weight. It's just : 9.3cm x 5cm. It will fit right into your luggage or even your pockets without taking up any noticeable space, and it only weights 5oz! It can be easily carried anywhere!  USB Powered - Connect the pump to any USB powered device (Phone Adapter/Power Bank etc.) to power and charge the pump. One Button access - Using this pump is very easy. There is only one button on the device. Once you have filled up the Vacuum Storage Bags, place the pump over the bag's air valve and press the button to get it working. There are 2 Ports: One port for vacuuming and one for inflating. You do not need to constantly monitor the pump while it is at work. Free up your time to do other important tasks! High Quality Eco Friendly Materials - The travel vacuum storage bags are made of premium and high-quality PE+PA materials, durable and can last for years. Pump is waterproof rated IPX4 so that it be used for wet activities Inflate - Hjemstuff Portable Mini Automatic USB Vacuum Pump & Inflator inflates at 265L/min. Super fast!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H7UUSw34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hjemstuff","source_asin":"B07TYRRYMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYRRYMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYRRYMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
