window.products.push({"id":342309,"name":"Mom Gifts for Mothers Day Rose Flower Gifts for Women, Angel Rose, Preserved Rose Birthday Gifts for Women Grandma Mom, Rose Flower Gifts, Mother Day ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716kF971NjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ღMother's Day giftsღ: Red roses symbolize love, respect.Blue roses honesty and kindness.Purple roses represent romance, truth and preciousness.Pink roses represent warmth, appreciation and compassion.Roses combine love and beauty.It is not only the incarnation of the beautiful god.The never-fading flower represents fiery love,and the angel represents protection,holiness, kindness,and good wishes. Angel gifts are a way to express your love and symbolize your endless love and blessings for her. ღMothers Day angelღ: A beautifully crafted preserved rose is a gift that never fails to speak volumes, whether it says, \"Happy birthday\", \"Thank you\", \"Happy Anniversary\" or \"I love you\", Preserved flowers are made of real fresh roses, which are processed by workers with fresh-keeping technology to maintain the color,shape and feel of the flowers. Angel roses symbolize eternal love,harmonious family and loyal friendship. Angel statues also mean good blessings. ღMothers Day Preserved Roseღ: Supposing you have to rack your brains to find a unique way to commemorate an event or surprise your loved ones? Perfect gift for a special date such as anniversaries and festivals. At the same time, it is a perfect gift for Valentine's Day,Mother's Day ,Thanksgiving Day,Christmas.Our rose flowers are wonderful gifts for Birthday, Party, Wedding,Graduations, Teachers’Day, Anniversaries.fresh rose will be your nice choice and make a truly lasting impression. ღMothers Day decorღ: Place in the living room,bedroom,office and other places for decoration to create a warm and fresh atmosphere.It is also very suitable for being added to the office,creating a healing office atmosphere. The product can be used after opening the package,without any tedious work,you can decorate the environment around you. ღMother's Day flowersღ: Elegant European style,pure handmade,a variety of beautiful very suitable for wedding scene,birthday party and home decoration.Made of high quality clear glass.Handcrafted glass figure of a standing angel with a golden outline halo,hands crossed and holding a heart,The perfect gift for empathy remembrance and healing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716kF971NjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WALFITE","source_asin":"B0C3LXSG32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3LXSG32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3LXSG32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
