window.products.push({"id":342347,"name":"Easy to Install Door Draft Stopper, Under Door Noise Air Cold Blocker Seal Bottom of Doors 30\" to 36\", Adjustable Door Sweep Soundproof Guard, Interio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EwxSA4AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔶Works On Any Floor Surface: Our door draft blocker easily moves with the door and glides easily on carpet, wood, tile, vinyl. It's great for blocking out dust, sand, light and insects. Perfect for any type of door bottom such as glass, wood, plastic, aluminum alloy and bathroom doors; No need to bend down and re-position. 🔶Large Size Draft Stopper：The draft stopper covers gaps up to 2 inches because our foam is 100% thicker than other brands. It can stop cold and hot air from escaping to stabilize the temperature in your home which can help you save some payment on your yearly energy bill. 🔶Easy to Install: You don't need to use tape or nails to install this door draft stopper. You only need to measure the gap and width of the door and cut the foam tubes to a certain size, then put the foam into the fabric cover, finally slide the windshield into the bottoms of the door. 🔶Noise Reduction & Windshield: Door draft stopper can reduce the noise and block the cold/hot wind/smoke outside, making the indoor more comfortable.This door weather stripping can be adjustable from 32\" to 36\", You can easily measure and cut the foam tubes on our door draft stoppers to seal gaps in your doors perfectly. 🔶EXCELLENT AFTER-SALES: We provide 7x24 hours customer mail service. If you have any questions about the Under Door Draft Stopper, please feel free to contact us and let us know how to make it right, Refund & Exchange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EwxSA4AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DNC","source_asin":"B086YPJQM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086YPJQM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086YPJQM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342348,"name":"QUQIYSO French Press Coffee Maker 304 Stainless Steel French Press with 4 Filter, Heat Resistant Durable, Easy to Clean, Borosilicate Glass Coffee Pre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612v19vtE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕SUPER FILTERING - The quality of the coffee press greatly depends on the quality of the filter element. So the selection of springs is extremely important for the filtering of coffee powder, which will directly affect the taste of coffee. Our perforated plate could filter out big coffee grounds, and the 80 mesh filter could filter out tiny coffee ground ☕EASY TO USE - The French Press is the easiest to concentrate on the condition of the beans among the many devices. You can see the amount of foam (crema) after the coffee touches the water, and how the coffee floats on the water and slowly sinks. QUQIYSO coffee press is perfect for both professional barista and novice coffee lovers ☕MULTIPLE USES - Besides using the french press as a coffee maker, it is also handy appliance to make tea, hot chocolate, cold brew, frothed milk, almond milk, cashew milk, fruit infusions, and plant and herbal drinks ☕CARE INSTRUCTIONS - The glass beaker, filter and plunger are dishwasher safe. Lid should be hand washed with a non-abrasive sponge and a mild dish soap, careful to avoid rough scrubbers and brushes as this can scratch and dull the finish 💝CUSTOMER SUPPORT - We care about your experience with our products. Our French press coffee makers come with 2-Year Replacement Policy. For ANY quality-related issues, we will send you a replacement for free or give you a full refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612v19vtE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUQIYSO","source_asin":"B0B58GYJ6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B58GYJ6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B58GYJ6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342349,"name":"Orchid Nerd 11\" Metal Wire Plant Support and Garden Stake 10pk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EjCCXHoCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Top heavy and tall garden plants need a little bit of extra help to keep them from toppling over and snapping, but why ruin a beautiful arrangement with boring plant support cages? Easy to use just place the stem to slide through slot into loop. This will help your support your plant and minimize the chance of those stems are less likely to curve, crease in steam, break or lose blossoms especially when stems are covered with open blossoms and buds during windy periods. This innovative design allows you to introduce support to even fully grown plants without the risk of damage. The strong solid frame is sturdy enough to insert into even soil . It’s suited to either indoor or outdoor use, giving your green fingers total flexibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EjCCXHoCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orchid Nerd","source_asin":"B0BG693ZGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG693ZGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG693ZGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
