window.products.push({"id":342410,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake 2017 Disney Tangled Rapunzel in The Swing Solar Motion Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VX7vfA1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Disney movie \"Tangled,\" Rapunzel and her chameleon pal Pascal make good use of the princess's long hair by forming a swing from a tree. Place this unique solar-powered Christmas ornament in direct light to activate the swinging motion—no batteries required! Festive and collectible, Hallmark Keepsake Ornaments come ready to give in a seasonal holiday gift box. The box can also be used for ornament storage. Place the ornament in direct light to activate a solar cell that powers Rapunzel's movement. This Hallmark Keepsake Ornament measures 3 x 3.6 x 2.8 inches and comes in a 4 x 5 x 2.9 gift box. Magic Solar Motion Ornament is made of plastic and features movement. Designed by Patricia Andrews. Each piece includes one 2017 Disney Tangled Rapunzel In the Swing Solar Motion Christmas Ornament in a gift-ready box. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones, there's a Keepsake Ornament for everyone on your list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. This Hallmark original Keepsake Ornament features unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail. The ornament is lead-free and made for years of celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VX7vfA1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B01NHBVPM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NHBVPM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NHBVPM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342411,"name":"Now Designs Utensil Crock, Hometown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqxA5P-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your kitchen utensils a beautiful storage option. Overflowing with subtle style this Hometown Utensil Crock by Now Designs graces your counter or stovetop while wrangling your essential cooking tools to keep them close at hand for stirring, flipping or whisking. This stoneware is shaped like a cozy house that fits all of your most-used cooking utensils. When you open the drawer and it is overflowing, select those that are your essential go-to tools and keep them findable and conveniently close. The white glossy finish is designed to add that little extra to your countertop. The durable finish wipes clean, or a quick wash in the sink will have it ready to keep your kitchen organized again. Now Designs creates items that make your kitchen functional and add effortless style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqxA5P-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B078Y163BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078Y163BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078Y163BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
