window.products.push({"id":342493,"name":"Natural Goose Down Throw Blanket Couch,Bed Comforter,Sofa Blanket Throw,Outdoor Blanket Gifts,Lightweight Down Comforter with Peach Skin Fabric,Revers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFfZXzkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👌Goose Down Blanket Throw: Deodar down throw blanket is filled with 75% natural goose down and 25% goose feather. The goose down throw is soft, fluffy and lightweight. Besides, there are thousands small pores in down that moisture absorption and breathability. When you put it on your shoulder, lap or lie, this blanket will make you feel warm and comfortable. ❤OEKO-TEX Certification: The throw blanket is authorized with OEKO-TEX certification, and the down and feather used in our blankets have been certified to the RDS (Responsible Down Standard). You can safely use it. We aim to offer you a better quality sleeping experience and warm care. ☺Fine Workmanship: Our 50\"X70\" quilted blanket with box stitching design prevent down and feather from shifting. It ensures the down filling spread over the entire surface of the throw which can make the level of warmth and coziness is the same. Also the odor repellent will prevent chemical smell, so the cozy down throw will make you no need to worry about the smell. 👍Fashion & Comfortable: 100% peach skin velvet fabric is covered with 0.2mm of short pile in the dyeing and finishing process tightly, just like the surface of a peach. Short pile can also make blanket more durable and stronger than others. And the down throw blankets with elegant appearance can make you feel comfortable. 👍Seasons & Widely used: The down blanket can be used in Spring, Summer, Autumn or other warm climates region, and easy to pack. It is designed for home and travel. You can use it as a lap throw, sofa comforter, couch throw, bed blanekt, outdoor blanket or camping blanket. Let you easy to carry and feel warm when you need any time and any where. 📞Easy to Care: The quilted throw benefits from delicate sewing and premium fabric. We recommend a gentle machine wash in cold water followed by a tumble dry in low heat to maintain maximum performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFfZXzkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deodar","source_asin":"B0967YQWF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0967YQWF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0967YQWF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
