window.products.push({"id":342601,"name":"VUZALRANO Stainless Steel Buddhist Six True Mantra Om Mani Padme Hum Lotus Urn Urn Cremation Jewelry for Ashes Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r7ZEuYBcL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"What is Cremation Jewelry? Cremation jewelry, also known as memorial or keepsake jewelry and is used as a way to memorialize a loved one. It is available in the form of pendants, bracelets, necklaces, etc. A small amount of the cremated remains (ashes) are placed in the memorial jewelry. Cremation jewelry can also hold dried flowers, a lock of hair or soil from a gravesite. Many find that wearing cremation jewelry is comforting since it allows one to carry their departed loved one close to them. Can be used as: -ashes necklace - cremation jewelry for ashes - urns for human ashes necklace - urn necklace for ashes - urn pendant for ashes - urn necklaces for ashes for women men - cremation pendants for ashes - ash lockets- urn jewelry for human ashes -memorial necklace for ashes - chain for ashes - ashes keepsake- jewelry for ashes - cremation ashes- urn for human ashes adult - pet urn can be used to hold your special messages,hair, loved one or pet's ashes,human's ashes How to use the urn jewelry? 1 . Locate the pendant opening . Depending on the piece , this can be the bail itself ( the Ioop that the chain goes through ) or a small , square screw somewhere on the pendant . 2 . Using the screwdriver we provide , unscrew the pendant and pIace the provided funnel into the opening . 3 . Fill the pendant about 90 % full , making Sure to leave room to replace the screw . A pin we provide can help guide the remains into the opening . 4 . Sealant is not necessary as all of our precious metal cremation jewelry pendants and rings have a black rubber gasket on the threaded screw making them alr and Water tight .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r7ZEuYBcL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VUZALRANO","source_asin":"B09TP5LZ8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TP5LZ8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TP5LZ8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
