window.products.push({"id":342639,"name":"Winarrive dish drying mat, 24\" silicone drying mat for kitchen counter with dish drying rack, coffee mat with 2 pieces cleaning rags, Gadgets Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUGLwqqgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: There are two size conversion methods for the silicone drain mat we supply. The size is 24*13 inches when unfolded and 13*8 inches when folded. When unfolded, this product can be used for large tableware such as pots and pans or a large number of vegetables and fruits. When folded, it can be used for small tableware such as cups and spoons or a small amount of fruits. What you get: The silicone drain mat set we supply contains a large size food-grade dish drying mat, which is safe and non-toxic. The silicone mat can withstand temperatures from -40°C to 230°C/-40°F to 446°F, and can be stored in the refrigerator and dishwasher. In addition, a food grade stainless steel drain rack and two dishcloths can perfectly handle all problems of tableware drain. Convenient storage: When users do not need to use the silicone drain pad, it has three storage methods.A hole in the top allows the mat to hang from any hook in the kitchen. The user can also roll up the mat like a scroll, and bind the rope specially designed for the edge of the silicone mat, which is very space-saving. Users can also fold up the MATS and place them on the kitchen table. No matter what the layout of the kitchen is, users can easily store our silicone mat. Easy to clean: The special convex water diversion design of the dish drying mat makes it very easy to dry, and it will not always be wet like the traditional fiber pad. When the user needs to clean it, just put it in the dishwasher to clean it. It can also be manually rinsed, and it will be as new as before. Warm reminder: We warmly welcome customers to buy with our high-quality service. If you have any product questions, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide you with a satisfactory solution on every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUGLwqqgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winarrive","source_asin":"B0BPBVGYQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBVGYQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBVGYQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
