window.products.push({"id":342673,"name":"Baxton Studio Cora Modern and Contemporary Light Pink Velvet Fabric Upholstered Queen Size Headboard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310vBW4u6tL._AC_.jpg","description":"The beautiful curves of the Cora headboard will make you feel like royalty each and every night. Constructed from solid rubberwood and plywood, the Cora is upholstered in a soft, foam filled velvet polyester fabric that provides ample comfort for you to lean against. Button-tufting adds a regal touch. Leg supports are invisible once set up and can be adjusted to suit the height of your ensemble, for convenience. The headboard sits between the wall and the ensemble frame, attaching not to the bed base but to the legs, for stability. The Cora headboard is made in Malaysia and requires assembly.Features Modern and contemporary upholstered headboardCurved shape with button tufting and silver nailhead trim for a glamorous lookHeadboard comes with 2 pre-drilled holes (with height from ground up of 5.5\" and 8\") that go with any Leggett and Platt bedframeUpper part on the back of the headboard's legs comes with 5 predrilled holes with 2.55\" apart from one another for height adjustmentConstructed from rubberwood and plywoodVelvet polyester fabricAssembly requiredSET INCLUDES: One (1) Queen Size HeadboardFULL DIMENSIONS: Dimensions: 56.3\" High x 60.8\" Wide x 2.3\" Deep; Height (from Floor to the Top for Each Post Point): Position 1: 56.3\" High; Position 2: 53.9\" High; Position 3: 51.4\" High; Position 4: 48.8\" High; Headboard Dimensions: 26\" High x 60.8\" Wide x 2.3\" ThickTAFTING: Button TuftingASSEMBLY: Assembly RequiredSTYLE: ContemporarySERIES: SelectPRODUCT COMPOSITION: Fabric Velvet \"Polyester 100%\"/MDF/FoamPRIMARY UPHOLSTERY : Fabric Velvet \"Polyester 100%\"PRIMARY FRAME: MDFFOAM: FoamCOLORS AND FINISHING: Light PinkMAIN UPHOLSTERY COLOR: PinkLEG FINISHING: Black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310vBW4u6tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B07WZL6PDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WZL6PDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WZL6PDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342674,"name":"BulbHead Red Copper Double-Coated 9.5-Inch Square Dance Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Acgjk8B0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic copper-infused cookware. When your meal won’t fit, you’re ready to quit. The Red Copper Square Dance Pan replaces your old, tired pan. The 9.5” square pan can accommodate more food than a traditional round pan. This Square Dance pan has an upgraded double-coated, ceramic copper-infused coating that is nonstick and scratch-resistant . When seasoned as per packages directions, your food will slide right out of the pan! No scrapping, no scratching needed. Little to no oil, butter, or grease is needed while cooking, allowing you to cook healthier home cooked meals. Versatile and safe. Have peace of mind while cooking. Red Copper cookware does not contain any PFOAs or PTFEs. These chemicals are normally added to nonstick cookware, but begin to disintegrate at high heats. This causes the coating to flake off into food and potentially ingested. This Red Copper pan is oven safe up to 500-degrees Fahrenheit. Easily transition from stovetop to oven to make a breakfast biscuit casserole. Or serve up 16 sliders at once! Retire your pan and upgrade to a Square Dance pan to make everything from desserts, pizzas, and pancakes. It works on any stovetop – gas, glass, electric, and even induction! Good to know. To ensure you get the most out of your Red Copper pan, an initial seasoning is required prior to use. Instructions are included. Occasional seasoning may be required for maintenance and optimal performance. The Red Copper Square Dance pan should be hand-washed in warm water with mild soap and towel dried. Includes 1 Red Copper Double-Coated Square Dance Pan and recipe guide. Packaging may vary. Item may not ship in retail packaging. You’ll be dancing all day when you use the Red Copper Square Dance Pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Acgjk8B0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BulbHead","source_asin":"B075F75248","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075F75248","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075F75248","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
