window.products.push({"id":342697,"name":"SE SOFTEXLY Sherpa Throw Blanket,Soft Blanket with 30% Wool and 70% Cotton for Winter,Fuzzy Cozy Thick Blanket,Warm Winter Blanket for Couch Bed Sofa ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OIMjgv6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"30% WOOL MATERIAL: Our sherpa back throw with 70% yarn-dyed cotton and 30% wool on the front and soft sherpa fabric on the back which the softness is comparable to real wool. The skin-friendly of cotton combine outstanding warmth of wool make a sherpa throw is both warm and durable. It is creates a strong insulation and combined with its amazing heat insulation, provides protection against the wind and cold weather, It is the ultimate winter must-have. CLOUD COMFY: This sherpa blanket is made using high grade 550 GSM (gram per square meter) of premium material. GSM refers to the weight of the blanket filling. The higher the GSM of filling in the blanket, the warmer, softer and more luxurious it is. our 550GSM sherpa blanket offers you extreme softness and warmth to improve your sleep, is perfect for colder climates and cold sleepers. DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: SE SOFTEXLY blanket has undergone numerous experiments and adopt double-sided stitching technology to ensure it won't shed lint and shrinkage after machine washed, adding years of life to the blanket , making it more durability. We pay close attention to detail to ensure that every blankets we produce meets our highest standards. SAFE & HEALTHY: SE SOFTEXLY blankets is composed of 100% hypoallergenic natural materials and no harmful chemicals or synthetic.Our products are certified by OEKO-TEX Standard 100 and Sedex, an independent certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards, ensure it safe for you and your family. LIGHTWEIGHT：Our sherpa blankets have awesome qualities, so you may think that the fabric is heavy and bulky. This could not be farther from the truth. Despite its thickness and plushness, the sherpa material is actual lightweight and not bulky! You can actually have it in the car or in the bag to keep you warm and cozy wherever you go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OIMjgv6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SE SOFTEXLY","source_asin":"B09JLK4WFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLK4WFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLK4WFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
