window.products.push({"id":342765,"name":"200PCS Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner and 200PCS gloves,Non-stick Disposable , Baking Paper for Air Fryer Oil-proof, Water-proof, Parchment for Baki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yZhInGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The air fryer disposable paper is made of 100% food grade parchment paper material with strict quality standards, and the unbleached paper is completely non-fluorescent. Thicker than regular parchment . The disposable thickened air fryer paper is suitable for microwave ovens, ovens, cookers, air fryers, etc. These air fryer parchment paper can be used to bake, and fry foods. The curved design of the food clip is easy to hold and does non slipping. Thickened hand clip, waterproof, non-slipping, anti-scalding. After baking, the disposable paper of the air fryer can be easily thrown away, no need to clean the air fryer, saving water and money! Also, saving you your precious time and effort. Hot air blowing air fryer paper into the heat pipe will cause the paper to burn. Always use when the paper has enough food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yZhInGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TONINT","source_asin":"B09V2C78BT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V2C78BT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V2C78BT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
