window.products.push({"id":342829,"name":"Joeyan Rotatable Hand Painted Whiskey Glasses with Coaster,Old Fashioned Glass Tumblers with Strip and Diamond Patterns,Colorful Whiskey Glass Cups fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LFiuStVLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGN STYLE: This whiskey glass cups set is original design and with paintings by hand. The cups are with strip and diamond patterns, and there are different colors painted on them, which is more delicate and eye-catching. Not only glassware for daily use, but also a beautiful decoration on the dining table. QUALITY MATERIAL: Elegant whiskey glasses are made from premium quality glass, thick walls and base make it very stable. This bright painted glass body gives your the best tasting experience. They are lead free, BPA free, food-safe grade, it is comfortable to the touch and durable to use. SPECIFICATION: The height: 3.2\"/8cm, diameter: 2.9\"/7.5cm, base diameter: 4.3\"/11cm, the capacity is 270ml/9oz. Packing Includes: 2 packs. Dishwasher safe, but for better preservation of the whiskey glasses, we recommend hand wash. OCCASIONS FOR USE: This set of whisky glasses is perfect for various drinks, such as Rum, Bourbon, Scotch, Whiskey, Cocktail and Liquor. It is a bonus to your glassware collection and also a good gift for birthdays, housewarmings, weddings, Mother’s Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Anniversary. BRAND SERVICE: If you have any issue with our whisky glasses, please contact us via \"Contact Seller\". We will reply within 24 hours and propose solutions to solve your problem till you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LFiuStVLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joeyan","source_asin":"B0B3SN9PJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3SN9PJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3SN9PJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":342830,"name":"Dragonflies Feast by Elizabeth Claire, 18x18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QcfhPq4jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a Group of dragonflies Flying around a blue sky. I am Elizabeth an industrial engineer who became curious and then passionate about art since high school when instead of art I was taking chemistry. While in college I was attracted by craft magazines. When I was not studying I was sewing, or cross stitching something. Never enrolled in art courses. I was attracted to ceramics after finishing my degree and having my three sons. I used to walk through art and craft stores admiring artists who I1/2had the most amazing opportunity of selling the art on Storesi1/2. I have been creating ceramic art since 1996 and mixed media, collage and painting since 2009. I sell my art through local stores in San Juan, Puerto Rico where tons of tourists and local customers visit. If someone asks me what is your biggest accomplishment I will not hesitate on telling that after my sons, who are just amazing, my most celebrated accomplishment is selling my art in that store that I used to walk and dream. Never imagined that one day some of my pieces where going to be reproduced and sell through a catalog. Now I am pursuing the dream of selling my art in many places around the world through licensing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QcfhPq4jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B075SXR3QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075SXR3QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075SXR3QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
