window.products.push({"id":342985,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Lightweight Cotton Flannel Sham - Standard, Winter Village Cadet Forest Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I+eMTG-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Single standard-size flannel sham. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com 160-gram cotton flannel pillow sham with winter village print. view larger Printed Cotton Flannel Sham What You Need to Know: Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Fits any standard-size pillow Fits any standard-size pillow Variety of colors and styles available Variety of colors and styles available Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and duvet covers (sold separately) Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and duvet covers (sold separately) Made in Portugal; machine washable Made in Portugal; machine washable Pinzon 160-Gram Printed Cotton Flannel Sham A beautiful accent to any well-made bed, this cotton flannel sham by Pinzon helps give your bedroom a fresh new look. The printed sham fits over any existing standard-size pillow and features an elegant border along the edges for extra flair. Go from boring to brilliant in seconds. Winter Village Print The pillow sham features a solid, snowy white background that functions as the peaceful landscape to its charming winter village. In a choice of Cadet Blue or Forest Green, the print consists of little log cabins sitting nestled together near magnificent deciduous and evergreen trees. Ideal for a kid's room, master bedroom, or guest room, the pillow sham makes a warm and decorative choice for those long, dark, winter nights. 100% Cotton Flannel In addition to its winter village print, the pillow sham provides exceptional softness. Woven from 100-percent cotton, the comfortable fabric has a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, which equals coziness you'll want to curl up with. Coordinates Beautifully The pillow sham works well with existing bedding and coordinates beautifully with Pinzon's matching 160-gram solid flannel sheets and duvet covers (sold separately). Machine Washable Made in Portugal, the imported 160-gram printed cotton flannel pillow sham is machine-washable and can go in the dryer for easy care. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I+eMTG-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00CL4SMV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-342985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CL4SMV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CL4SMV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
